# No environment variables are required for the current scaffold or curated Scripture content.
# Scripture configuration and translation availability live in src/content/scripture/.
# When implemented, configure Amplify Gen 2 with the target backend's generated amplify_outputs.json.
# Generate client outputs from the AWS sandbox or deployed environment; do not invent values.
# Never bundle static AWS access keys, deployment credentials, or backend secrets in the app,
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables, or client outputs. Cognito/Amplify handle authenticated app access.
# Keep backend secrets in Amplify backend secret configuration, out of Git and diagnostics.
